## **📱 CELL 6: Train Model**

```python
print("\n" + "="*80)
print(f"TRAINING {MODEL_NAME}")
print("="*80)

# Train and measure time
print(f"⏳ Training started...")
start_time = time.time()

model.fit(X_train, y_train)

training_time = time.time() - start_time

